Schemas for tcs-gui's own node descriptions, the files under share/nodes that
say what each node type asks for and how tcs-gui draws it.

    node.xsd             a description, written in XML
    node.schema.json     the same, written in YAML

The schemas of the configurations tcs-gui edits -- XTCS and YTCS -- are not
here: they are tcsprotocol's, in tcsprotocol/schema, since every program
reads those formats.

Installed by `make install-data` under $(PREFIX)/share/tcs-gui/schema.
